/*
 * muse_learn_art_headphones.c -- headphones learn-card icon master.
 *
 * Replaces the microphone master 2026-11-21, when «英语口语» became
 * «英语听力» (user decision): the row is about listening, so the icon
 * is a pair of headphones instead of a mic.
 *
 * Source: game-icons/icons, delapouite/headphones.svg (Delapouite,
 * CC BY 3.0 -- same repository and author as the other three cards,
 * keep the Game-icons attribution in the release notes). Rendered
 * 256x256 white on transparent, Lanczos down to the 128x128 master;
 * full-canvas path removed first.
 *
 * Pixel data (LVGL A8): one alpha byte per pixel, 128x128.
 * The UI recolours this mask per card at runtime
 * (lv_obj_set_style_image_recolor, MUSE_LEARN_ART_COLOR), so the
 * colour is not baked in here. See muse_learn_art.h for the source.
 */
